# Local state. The registry and every run live here, and the checkpoint store
# grows into the hundreds of megabytes — `*.sqlite` alone does not match
# `*.sqlite-wal`, `-shm`, or the `.sqlite.checkpoints` family, so all four
# shapes are listed rather than assumed.
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-*
*.sqlite.checkpoints
*.sqlite.checkpoints-*
*.sqlite-journal

